      "sourceTextSha256": "18fc250215cb1fe297e00748943c9c8c03df05df1a8cb953bc63eea37ad14aed",
      "text": "In the afternoon, tour the historic centre: the Main Square, the Cathedral, the Central Post Office and City Hall, La Moneda Government Palace and Santa Lucía Hill, the remnant of a 15-million-year-old volcano. Continue to East Santiago and its modern offices, apartments, shopping centres and restaurants.",
